yangchun-xiaoyong-contextual","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAABAA","surname":"楊","ming":"孝邕","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p025","person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p025:m0001","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"原人物錨只稱孝邕；姓楊為同源原全文名及逐步明名兄弟／父子的有資格編輯首選，拼合全名不是原quote，不生成共同父或新親屬。","surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_bounded_named_family_path","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"完整本單元已讀，按有限明名近系承接姓氏；兄弟不動世代，明父子才加一，不把兄弟轉成父子或以ID補姓。","source_name_record_id":"name-weishu058-yangyu-exact","source_full_quote":"未幾，屬元顥侵逼大梁，除昱征東將軍、右光祿大夫，加散騎常侍、使持節、假車騎將軍，為南道大都督，鎮滎陽。顥既擒濟陰王暉業，乘虛徑進，大兵集於城下，遣其左衞劉業、王道安等招昱，令降，昱不從，顥遂攻之。城陷，都督元恭，太守、西河王悰並踰城而走，俱被擒縶。昱與弟息五人，在門樓上，須臾顥至，執昱下城，面責昱曰：「楊昱，卿今死甘心否？卿自負我，非我負卿也。」昱答曰：「分不望生，向所以不下樓者，正慮亂兵耳。但恨八十老父，無人供養，負病黃泉，求乞小弟一命，便死不朽也。」顥乃拘之。明旦，顥將陳慶之、胡光等三百餘人伏顥帳前，請曰：「陛下渡江三千里，無遺鏃之費，昨日一朝殺傷五百餘人，求乞楊昱以快意。」顥曰：「我在江東，嘗聞梁主言，初下都日，袁昂為吳郡不降，稱其忠節。奈何殺楊昱？自此之外，任卿等所請。」於是斬昱下統帥三十七人，皆令蜀兵刳腹取心食之。顥既入洛，除昱名為民。","seed_frame":{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p023","paragraph_sha256":"d2c310e76cf9db2bf3178b2bb32e50df253ca51ec81b02f178896c4ea49f7262","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"},"steps":[{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-xiaoyong-father-yu","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAABA","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAABAA","traversal":"father_to_child","generation_before":0,"generation_after":1,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p024","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p024:m0033","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/weishu-weishou/058-yangchun.json"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws